axtb in ReShiki
===============

Component:  axtb, an implementation of the xTB methods (GFN2-xTB, GFN-FF, g-xTB)
License:    LGPL-3.0-or-later (COPYING.LESSER, with the GPL-3.0 text in COPYING)
Upstream:   https://github.com/atomsforhumanity/axtb (Colton Hicks)
Fork:       https://github.com/Ameyanagi/axtb, branch reshiki
Revision:   65d0f64a9a8211f73b0738ff908b7a414975f50b
Version:    0.2.0
Crates:     axtb, axtb-base, axtb-d4, axtb-driver, axtb-gfnff, axtb-gxtb,
            axtb-solvation

The files COPYING, COPYING.LESSER and NOTICE here are copied unchanged from
that revision. NOTICE lists the upstream projects axtb reproduces and the
g-xTB authors' permission for its g-xTB parts.

Only ReShiki builds with the Cargo feature `xtb` contain axtb: the macOS and
Linux desktop releases. Each such release publishes
reshiki-<version>-source.tar.gz on its GitHub release page
(https://github.com/Ameyanagi/ReShiki/releases), containing ReShiki's source,
this revision of the fork, every Cargo dependency, and BUILD-WITH-XTB.md with
the steps to rebuild ReShiki, including with a modified axtb.
